Hello volunteers,

Thank you all for signing up for the Port Ellen Regatta on the weekend of 2=
3=E2=80=9324 May. This message carries the schedule, the volunteer poster a=
nd the roles sheet; please read the roles sheet before the briefing.

The briefing is at the harbour office at 08:00 on Saturday. Tea and bacon r=
olls are provided =E2=80=94 bring a waterproof, the forecast is "changeable=
".

Parking at the quay is for competitors only. Volunteers park at the school =
on Mill Lane and walk down; it is five minutes.

If you can no longer make it, reply to this message by Wednesday so the ros=
ter can be redone. Replies go to the organisers, not to everyone.

See you on the quay,

--=20
Ada Abbott
Volunteer coordinator, Port Ellen Regatta
+44 7700 900123
